      "cooked": "<p>i cant edit the “erpnext integration” module, it says: “Could not find Row <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#20:</span> Link To: GoCardless Settings, Row <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#21:</span> Link To: Mpesa Settings”. i tried all the ways possible but cant fix it up. any solutions ?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4_2_690x199.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kCo0jgKMXJpt9GxXpuNhaUBN1Aw\" width=\"690\" height=\"199\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4_2_690x199.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/908256b1b9bca9a6101504b041814d4e566f17a4.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D1D1D1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">931×269 13.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
